<title>USA: Heartland CCD 540, Ill. won by Heartland Bank.</title>
<headline>Heartland CCD 540, Ill. won by Heartland Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heartland Bank &amp; Trust Co. said it won $1.69 million of Heartland Community College Dist No. 540, Ill., general obligation community college bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.12 percent.</p>
</text>
